<section class="page"><p class="eyebrow">OPERATIONS</p><h1>Source health</h1><p class="muted">A successful metadata request is not proof that a video can play.</p><div id="health-results" class="health-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
<section class="panel"><h2>Match an alternate source</h2><p>Only merge identities after checking the title, media type, year, and episode numbering. Favorites and progress move to the canonical title.</p><form id="merge-form"><label>Alternate title ID<input name="from" required pattern="[a-f0-9]{64}"></label><label>Canonical title ID<input name="to" required pattern="[a-f0-9]{64}"></label><button class="button" type="submit">Match titles</button><p class="form-message" role="status"></p></form></section></section>
